{"strongs": "H4038", "word": "מוֺלֶ֫דֶת", "translit": "mag.gal", "root": "יין", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "kindred, birth, offspring", "definition": "מוֺלֶ֫דֶת noun feminine kindred, birth, offspring ; — ׳ מ construct Lev 18:9 ; Lev 18:11 suffix מוֺלַדְתִּי Gen 24:4 + 3 t.; etc.; plural suffix מוֺלְדוֺתַיִךְ Ezek 16:4 מֹלְדֹתַיִךְ v Ezek 16:3 — 1. kindred Gen 12:1 (|| ארצך , בית אביך ), Gen 24:4 (|| ארץ ), Num 10:30 (|| id. ), Gen 31:3 (|| ארץ אבותיך ), Gen 43:7 (all J ); || עַם Esth 2:10 ; Esth 2:20 ; Esth 8:6 especially ׳ אֶרֶץ מ land of one's kindred Gen 11:28 ; Gen 24:7 (both J ), Gen 31:13 ( E ), Jer 22:10 ; Jer 46:16 ; Ezek 23:15 ; Ruth 2:11 . 2. plural circumstances of birth, birth (figurative of origin of Jerusalem) מֵאֶרֶץ הַכְּנַעֲנִי ׳ מְכֹרֹתַיִךְ וּמ Ezek 16:3 , compare v Ezek 16:4 . 3. (female) offspring, one born Lev 18:9 (twice in verse), begotten v Lev 18:11 (all H ); collective = issue, offspring מוֺלַדְתְּךָ אֲשֶׁר הוֺלַ֫דְתָּ Gen 48:6 ( P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3549')\">BDB3549</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4038')\">H4038</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3548')\">BDB3548</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3550')\">BDB3550</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מוֺלֶ֫דֶת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>kindred, birth, offspring</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> construct <ref ref=\"Lev 18:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,18,9)\">Lev 18:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 18:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,18,11)\">Lev 18:11</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מוֺלַדְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,4)\">Gen 24:4</ref> + 3 t.; etc.; plural suffix <bdbheb>מוֺלְדוֺתַיִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2